          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘડિયાળ — ghaḍiyāḷ — \"clock, watch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હું નવી ઘડિયાળ ખરીદીશ. — hũ navī ghaḍiyāḷ kharīdīś — \"I will buy a new watch.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘડિયાળ (ghaḍiyāḷ) is a tadbhava. It comes from ghaṭītāḍa, \"striking the time\", a reconstructed compound of ghaṭī, \"water-clock\", and tāḍa, \"striking\", and CDIAL glosses the Gujarati word \"clock\" (CDIAL 4413)."
            }
          ]
        },
